  "explanation": "copy = configs[:] is a shallow copy: the outer list is new, but the dict objects inside are shared with the caller. Mutating copy's dicts therefore rewrites the caller's settings too, so settings[0][\"verbose\"] prints True even though the intent was to only change the returned copy.",
